		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery31.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery31_hu_985aad179f1b8d40.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery31_hu_e02763971f67258a.jpg 1024w&#34;
