&lt;p&gt;在喀纳斯之前，我们还到了中国最西北的白哈巴，发现国境线对面的风景出奇的原始壮丽。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery4.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery4_hu_eefd26715ae1f8ae.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery4_hu_b25d80935f529327.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;白哈巴的中哈边境&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery41.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery41_hu_e542c453a4d53989.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery41_hu_f79ceac8b2ce5854.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;三人的边境证&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;帐篷只住了一晚上，先趁着寒潮没到看了看久违的星空，可惜设备太拉拍不出来现场的震撼。反正当天晚上听着风雨入眠，早上是被冷醒的。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery5.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1080&#34;
	height=&#34;1440&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery5_hu_b970f3169105ab2b.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery5_hu_1f96d60b65030a06.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;我和绍达戴着头灯搭帐篷&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;75&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;180px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;后来寒潮真来了，只能转投三百一晚的民宿，但不得不说是真的舒服！当天晚上还是自己在厨房做了饭当露营餐了，还看了场羽毛球决赛（虽然我忘记是啥比赛了）。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery6.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery6_hu_c0af91645c557d27.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery6_hu_fa4457598eed9d34.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;在民宿，早上拍到的彩虹&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;最搞笑的是我们三个在喀纳斯的各个景点只干了一件事：吃遍所有摊贩的烤肠。。。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;当然我们还在布尔津吃到了几年来在新疆吃到的最好吃的拌面！！！（歹歹的辣皮子拌面抓饭）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这趟Gap之旅（毕竟一个暑假都被关在学校），有人怕被熊拍死，有人挂着素质提升器到处喷，还有人不停地做计划结果全没赶上变化。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery7.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1084&#34;
	height=&#34;1752&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery7_hu_1f1351fa5b06c65b.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery7_hu_7698e39b0a824837.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;唯一的一张合照，还是回到学校顺风车司机拍的&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;61&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;148px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
